                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 10,
                      "fontWeight": "600",
                      "letterSpacing": 1.5
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Ke3Fm",
                      "name": "Reading Title",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The unreasonable effectiveness of simple systems",
                      "lineHeight": 1.08,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                      "fontSize": 42,
                      "fontWeight": "500"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "D4q53A",
                      "name": "Dek",
                      "fill": "$muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Why the most durable tools often begin with fewer assumptions — and how restraint compounds over time.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.35,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                      "fontSize": 20,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "fontStyle": "italic"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "w6Rbp9",
                      "name": "Byline",
                      "gap": 10,
                      "alignItems": "center",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "h0OLV",
                          "name": "Author",
                          "fill": "$ink",
                          "content": "Maya Chen",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": 12,
                          "fontWeight": "600"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "ellipse",
                          "id": "aJjg2",
                          "name": "Metadata Dot",
                          "fill": "$line",
                          "width": 3,
                          "height": 3
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "W1ghMP",
                          "name": "Published",
                          "fill": "$muted",
                          "content": "12 August 2026",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": 12,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "rectangle",
                      "id": "gtZWJ",
                      "name": "Article Rule",
                      "fill": "$line",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "height": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "e9Mu2O",
                      "name": "Article Body",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Complex systems are usually built one decision at a time. Each addition feels locally reasonable: another setting, another status, another escape hatch. Yet the systems we return to are often the ones that ask less of us.\n\nSimplicity is not the absence of capability. It is the result of arranging capability so that the common path remains obvious. The archive that survives is the archive whose owner can trust it without tending it every day.\n\nA useful principle follows: preserve the record first, then improve it. Background work may enrich what was saved, but should never determine whether it exists.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
